    },
    {
      "scene": "superpowers",
      "segment_index": 1,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "榜首个，superpowers，22万星技能框架，一天又涨千星。",
          "start": 0.1,
          "end": 4.8
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "据说涨星比发际线退得还快，把AI写代码变成可复用的技能系统",
          "start": 4.75,
          "end": 10.09
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "scene": "agent-reach",
      "segment_index": 2,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "Agent-Reach，搜Twitter、Reddit、B站、小红书，零API费不给平台交钱。",
          "start": 0.1,
          "end": 5.43
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "昨天127星，今天直接冲到700",
          "start": 5.38,
          "end": 8.89
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "scene": "career-ops",
      "segment_index": 3,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "再看career-ops，克劳德扣得做的AI求职系统，14种模式从简历到面试一条龙。",
          "start": 0.1,
          "end": 5.98
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "不是AI抢你工作，是帮你找",
          "start": 5.93,
          "end": 8.68
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "scene": "mempalace",
      "segment_index": 4,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "接着是MemPalace，给AI装了记忆系统就像加了海马体，基准测试开源榜首，5.4万星还在加速",
          "start": 0.1,
          "end": 7.27
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "scene": "mxc",
      "segment_index": 5,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "还有mxc，微软Rust做的容器隔离，比传统方案更轻更安全，568星但来头不小",
          "start": 0.1,
          "end": 6.85
        }
      ]
    },
    {
